======================================
Welcome to the hart refinement program
======================================

This is a command line program for performing Hirshfeld atom
refinement (HAR) on a crystal structure stored in a CIF file
using the Tonto library for quantum crystallography.

For detailed help, run the command:

   hart --help

If you publish any of the results from this program please
cite the following original scientific publications:

   D. Jayatilaka & B. Dittrich (2008) Acta Cryst. A 64 p. 383
   S. Capelli et al (2014) IUCrJ 1 p. 361
   M. Woinska et al (2016) Sci. Adv. 2 e1600192


===============
Program options
===============

You have run hart with the following options:
  --job urea
  --basis STO-3G
  --grid-accuracy low
  --residual-cube f
  --max-iterations 3
  --disk-sfs t
  urea_init.cif

